    "description": {
      "content": "OCTO (Open Connectivity for Tours, Activities, and Attractions) is an open standard API specification for the in-destination experiences sector of the travel industry. The standard defines agreed-upon schemas, endpoints, and capabilities commonly needed when connecting platforms, resellers, OTAs, and other technologies in tours, activities, and attractions._\n\nOCTO is open source. Available to anyone who wants to use it. You do not need to be a member to use this specification in your business.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: OCTO Standards NP Inc\n Email: sayhello@octo.travel",
